      "title": "How to use",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Old photo to living memory\n\n1. **Image Quality Enhance** restores and upscales the photo.\n2. **Seedance 2.0** animates the restored photo (first frame only) with subtle, natural motion.\n3. **Video Smoothness Enhance** finishes the clip.\n\nThe first group creates a stand-in old photo so the template runs as it is. To use your own photo, delete that group and paste a public https link into *image_url* of the restore node (or connect a Load Image; local images need a Comfy.org login). Needs ModelArk and MediaKit keys in Settings > BytePlus."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
